# Measures the actual scattering-angle distribution RefleX's Monte Carlo
# samples, directly from escaping photon direction vectors -- bypassing
# the pinhole camera/aperture entirely, and independent of how the DUMP
# command's THETA column should be interpreted.

VERBOSE 0
PERCENT ON
RANDOM 2026
NPHOTS 2000000
LENGTH Centimeter

PHYSICS COMPTON OFF
PHYSICS RAYLEIGH OFF
PHYSICS FLUOR OFF
PHYSICS PHOTO ON
PHYSICS DUST_PHOTO ON
PHYSICS DUST_SCAT ON
TEMPERATURE 0

EMSPEC MONO 4900
EMGEOM POINT 0.0 0.0 0.0 0 0 0.05
ECUT 100.0
EGEN 100.0 20000.0

MATTER wilm
METALLICITY 1.0
H2FRACTION 0.0
DUST 0.691

DENSITY 10.0

OBJECT WORLD 5.0e22
OBJECT DISC dustdisc 0.0 0.0 1.542839e22 5.983908e18 9.257033e20

# bit string, one digit per field, in the order listed in Section 6.2:
# COMPTON RAYLEIGH FLUOR DUSTSCAT NOBJ TIME ENERGY LENGTH NH DIR_X DIR_Y DIR_Z LOC_X LOC_Y LOC_Z POL_X POL_Y POL_Z
FIELDS 000100001110000000

EVENTS directions.fits
EVENTS DUSTSCAT > 0
